msgid "Pause forwarded traffic, client DNS and ordinary router traffic during startup and node switches. Management replies and proxy bootstrap remain available. If startup fails, keep blocking until a successful retry or an explicit service stop. Applies to all devices, including direct ACLs, during the transition."
msgstr "启动和切换节点期间暂停转发流量、客户端 DNS 和普通路由器出网，保留管理应答与代理启动连接。启动失败时持续阻断，直到重试成功或主动停止服务。切换期间所有设备（包括直连 ACL）均受保护。"

msgid "Unable to protect the network before updating the core."
msgstr "更新核心前无法启用网络保护，已取消更新。"

msgid "Pause traffic while switching. Verify processes, firewall and proxy connectivity before resuming. On failure, recover the last verified configuration; if recovery fails, keep blocking and retry automatically. An explicit stop restores normal networking. Direct ACLs also pause during transitions."
msgstr "切换期间暂停流量，确认进程、防火墙和代理连通后恢复。失败时回退最近验证成功的配置；恢复失败则保持阻断并自动重试。主动停止服务可恢复系统网络。直连设备在切换时也会暂停。"

