msgstr "已就绪"

msgid "Plus Overview"
msgstr "总览面板"

msgid "Global egress"
msgstr "全局出口"

msgid "Device egress"
msgstr "单设备出口"

msgid "Every device, its own exit."
msgstr "每台设备，都有自己的出口。"

msgid "Device identity, proxy routing and VPN protection in one place."
msgstr "设备身份、代理出口与 VPN 保护，在这里一目了然。"

msgid "Add device policy"
msgstr "新增设备策略"

msgid "Manage OpenVPN"
msgstr "管理 OpenVPN"

msgid "Device egress map"
msgstr "设备出口一览"

msgid "Rules run in order. A loaded rule is not a connectivity test."
msgstr "规则按顺序匹配；已加载规则不代表出口连通性已验证。"

msgid "Manage device policies"
msgstr "管理设备策略"

msgid "Find a device"
msgstr "查找设备"

msgid "Name, IP, MAC or exit"
msgstr "名称、IP、MAC 或出口"

msgid "OpenVPN tunnels"
msgstr "OpenVPN 隧道"

msgid "Tunnel state uses the process and route. Traffic counters belong to this tunnel session."
msgstr "根据进程和路由判断隧道状态；收发计数来自本次隧道会话。"

msgid "DHCP device discovery"
msgstr "发现 DHCP 设备"

msgid "An active lease is a configuration hint, not proof that a device is online."
msgstr "有效租约可用于填写设备配置，不代表设备当前在线。"

msgid "Bind a device"
msgstr "绑定设备"

msgid "A VPN exit for your whole network or one device."
msgstr "全网或单台设备，都能拥有 VPN 出口。"

msgid "Import a profile, choose its devices, and see the tunnel state here."
msgstr "导入配置、分配设备，在这里查看隧道状态。"

msgid "Add OpenVPN profile"
msgstr "新增 OpenVPN 配置"

msgid "Import profile"
msgstr "导入配置"

msgid "Read a local .ovpn file and check authentication, DNS and pre-proxy settings."
msgstr "读取本地 .ovpn 文件，检查认证、DNS 和前置代理设置。"

msgid "Assign an exit"
msgstr "分配出口"

msgid "Select it as the global exit or assign it to an IP/MAC-bound device."
msgstr "将其设为全局出口，或分配给已绑定 IP/MAC 的设备。"

msgid "Verify the tunnel"
msgstr "确认连接"

msgid "Check the tunnel route and switch health result after applying."
msgstr "应用后检查隧道路由和切换健康检查结果。"

msgid "Full IPv4 forwarding, with tunnel DNS"
msgstr "IPv4 全流量转发，DNS 跟随隧道"

msgid "Assigned traffic uses the VPN routing table. A dropped tunnel does not fall back to WAN. Local LAN access follows your policy; IPv6 rejection is configured separately."
msgstr "所分配的流量使用 VPN 路由表；隧道中断时不会回落到 WAN。局域网访问由策略控制，IPv6 拒绝策略需单独配置。"

msgid "Build a VPN exit"
msgstr "配置你的 VPN 出口"

msgid "Import the profile, complete authentication, then assign this exit to the global policy or individual devices."
msgstr "导入配置、补全认证，再将此出口分配给全局策略或单台设备。"

msgid "All OpenVPN profiles"
msgstr "全部 OpenVPN 配置"

msgid "Import .ovpn file"
msgstr "导入 .ovpn 文件"

msgid "The file is read locally into this form. Review it, then Save & Apply. Importing does not start a connection."
msgstr "文件在浏览器中读入表单。确认后点击“保存并应用”，导入本身不会启动连接。"

msgid "View or paste profile text"
msgstr "查看或粘贴配置文本"

msgid "One device. One clear routing policy."
msgstr "设备的身份与出口，清清楚楚。"

msgid "Choose the device identity first, then its exit. Save & Apply activates enabled rules."
msgstr "先确定设备身份，再选择出口；“保存并应用”后启用的规则才会生效。"

msgid "Select a DHCP device"
msgstr "选择 DHCP 设备"

msgid "Choosing a lease fills the MAC, IPv4 address and hostname and enables binding in this form. Existing DHCP conflicts are checked on save."
msgstr "选择租约后自动填入 MAC、IPv4 和主机名，并在表单中开启绑定；保存时会检查 DHCP 冲突。"

msgid "Use this device"
msgstr "使用此设备"

msgid "Give each device its own exit."
msgstr "为每台设备选择独立出口。"

msgid "Bind the device identity, choose a proxy or OpenVPN exit, and keep policy order explicit."
msgstr "绑定设备身份，选择代理或 OpenVPN 出口，并明确规则顺序。"

msgid "View device egress map"
msgstr "查看设备出口一览"

msgid "Rules match from top to bottom; the first matching rule wins. IP/MAC binding creates a permanent DHCP lease. OpenVPN device forwarding requires binding."
msgstr "规则从上到下匹配，首条命中的规则生效。IP/MAC 绑定会创建静态 DHCP 租约；单设备 OpenVPN 转发需要先完成绑定。"

msgid "Device and exit"
msgstr "设备与出口"

msgid "Routing details"
msgstr "路由细节"

msgid "Not started"
msgstr "未启动"

msgid "Tunnel route established"
msgstr "隧道路由已建立"

msgid "Connecting / reconnecting"
msgstr "连接或重连中"

msgid "Tunnel process absent"
msgstr "隧道进程未运行"

msgid "Device policies are off"
msgstr "设备策略总开关已关闭"

msgid "Protection / recovery in progress"
msgstr "切换保护或恢复中"

msgid "Runtime rule loaded"
msgstr "运行规则已加载"

msgid "No applied runtime record"
msgstr "暂无已应用记录"

msgid "Last switch verified"
msgstr "最近一次切换已验证"

msgid "Recovery pending; inspect logs"
msgstr "等待恢复，请查看日志"

msgid "Switch in progress"
msgstr "正在切换"

msgid "Assigned to"
msgstr "分配对象"

msgid "Global exit"
msgstr "全局出口"

msgid "Tunnel DNS"
msgstr "隧道 DNS"

msgid "Tunnel interface"
msgstr "隧道接口"

msgid "Received / sent"
msgstr "接收 / 发送"

msgid "Edit profile"
msgstr "编辑配置"

msgid "Assign devices"
msgstr "分配设备"

msgid "The switch controller is protecting or recovering the network. Check the result and logs before treating an exit as usable."
msgstr "切换控制器正在保护或恢复网络。请结合结果和日志确认出口是否可用。"

msgid "Switch protection is disabled. Enable it in Global egress to pause traffic during node changes."
msgstr "切换保护已关闭。在“全局出口”中开启后，节点切换期间会暂停流量。"

msgid "Switch protection verifies the proxy or VPN before resuming traffic. The last result is not a continuous Internet health test."
msgstr "切换保护会验证代理或 VPN 后再恢复流量。这里显示最近一次结果，不代表持续的互联网连通性检测。"

msgid "IPv6 rejection configured for:"
msgstr "已配置 IPv6 拒绝区域："

msgid "IPv6 rejection is disabled"
msgstr "IPv6 拒绝策略已关闭"

msgid "Protection settings"
msgstr "保护设置"

msgid "All sources"
msgstr "所有来源"

msgid "Follow global configuration"
msgstr "跟随全局配置"

msgid "OpenVPN full IPv4 forwarding"
msgstr "OpenVPN IPv4 全流量转发"

msgid "Device routing policy"
msgstr "独立设备路由策略"

msgid "IP/MAC binding"
msgstr "IP/MAC 绑定"

msgid "Source matching"
msgstr "来源匹配"

msgid "Matching DHCP lease"
msgstr "DHCP 租约与绑定一致"

msgid "DHCP address differs; renew the lease"
msgstr "DHCP 地址与绑定不同，请更新租约"

msgid "No current DHCP lease"
msgstr "暂无有效 DHCP 租约"

msgid "All interfaces"
msgstr "所有接口"

msgid "Connectivity not measured here"
msgstr "此处不检测出口连通性"

msgid "No matching devices."
msgstr "没有匹配的设备。"

msgid "No device policies yet. Add a device, bind its IP/MAC, then choose an exit."
msgstr "还没有设备策略。新增设备，绑定 IP/MAC，再选择出口。"

msgid "No OpenVPN profiles yet. Import your first profile to get started."
msgstr "还没有 OpenVPN 配置，先导入一份配置开始使用。"

msgid "OpenVPN is not installed. Install the OpenVPN component first."
msgstr "尚未安装 OpenVPN，请先安装 OpenVPN 组件。"

msgid "No exit selected"
msgstr "尚未选择出口"

msgid "Global proxy off"
msgstr "全局代理已关闭"

msgid "Saved selection; runtime state shown below"
msgstr "当前保存的出口；运行记录见下方"

msgid "Device policies can run independently"
msgstr "单设备策略可独立运行"

msgid "Device policies"
msgstr "设备策略"

msgid "Enabled rules / all rules"
msgstr "已启用规则 / 全部规则"

msgid "Device policy master switch is off"
msgstr "设备策略总开关已关闭"

msgid "Established routes / configured profiles"
msgstr "已建立路由 / 全部配置"

msgid "Device identity"
msgstr "设备身份绑定"

msgid "Policies with IP/MAC binding"
msgstr "已配置 IP/MAC 绑定的规则"

msgid "No current DHCP leases. Devices with static addresses can be entered manually."
msgstr "暂无有效 DHCP 租约，静态地址设备可手动填写。"

msgid "Unnamed device"
msgstr "未命名设备"

msgid "Updated"
msgstr "更新时间"

msgid "Refreshes every 10 seconds"
msgstr "每 10 秒刷新"

msgid "Status refresh failed. Displayed values may be stale; check your connection or sign in again."
msgstr "状态刷新失败，当前显示的数据可能已过期。请检查连接或重新登录。"

msgid "enabled device rules"
msgstr "条已启用设备规则"

msgid "This profile requests a username and password. Enter them in the authentication fields below; profile-embedded credentials are not used."
msgstr "配置要求账号密码，请在下方认证字段中填写；不会使用配置文件内嵌的账号密码。"

msgid "External certificate/key files are referenced. Use a profile with inline certificates, or ensure the referenced files exist on the router."
msgstr "配置引用了外部证书或密钥。请使用内嵌证书的配置，或确认对应文件已在路由器上。"

msgid "Pre-proxy uses TCP. Confirm that the VPN server supports TCP on this port; a UDP-only endpoint will not work."
msgstr "前置代理使用 TCP，请确认 VPN 服务端在此端口支持 TCP；仅支持 UDP 的端点无法使用。"

msgid "Server endpoints"
msgstr "服务器端点"

msgid "Profile transport"
msgstr "配置传输协议"

msgid "Inline certificate blocks"
msgstr "内嵌材料块"

msgid "Profile structure detected. Authentication and connectivity are verified only when the tunnel starts."
msgstr "已识别配置结构，实际认证和连通性需要启动隧道后验证。"

msgid "Imported into the form; not applied yet."
msgstr "已读入表单，尚未应用。"

msgid "Import failed; the previous profile was kept."
msgstr "导入失败，已保留原有配置。"

msgid "Policy preview"
msgstr "策略预览"

msgid "Choose a device identity"
msgstr "请先填写设备身份"

msgid "This rule will be enabled after Save & Apply."
msgstr "此规则将在“保存并应用”后启用。"

msgid "This rule is disabled. Enable it when the configuration is ready."
msgstr "此规则尚未启用，配置完成后请开启。"

msgid "The device policy master switch is off. Enabled rules with binding turn it on when saved; otherwise enable it on the device policies page."
msgstr "设备策略总开关已关闭。保存已启用且开启绑定的规则时会自动开启；未使用绑定时，请在设备策略页手动开启。"

msgid "OpenVPN forwards all IPv4 traffic and port 53 DNS through the tunnel."
msgstr "OpenVPN 通过隧道转发全部 IPv4 流量及 53 端口 DNS。"

msgid "Local LAN access is allowed."
msgstr "允许访问本地局域网。"

msgid "Local LAN access is isolated except DHCP."
msgstr "隔离本地局域网访问，仅保留 DHCP。"

msgid "Device details filled. Review the exit and enable the rule before applying."
msgstr "已填入设备信息。请检查出口并启用规则，再应用配置。"

msgid "Choose a device…"
msgstr "请选择设备…"

msgid "Leases do not prove a device is online. You can also enter a static address below."
msgstr "租约不代表设备当前在线，也可以在下方手动填写静态地址。"

msgid "No current DHCP leases. Enter the device MAC and IPv4 address below."
msgstr "暂无有效 DHCP 租约，请在下方填写设备 MAC 和 IPv4 地址。"

msgid "Device discovery unavailable"
msgstr "暂时无法发现设备"

msgid "Could not load leases. Enter the device details manually or reload this page."
msgstr "租约加载失败，可手动填写设备信息或刷新页面。"

msgid "This firmware requires an IPv4 address or hostname in a remote directive."
msgstr "此固件需要 remote 指令使用 IPv4 地址或主机名。"

msgid "Firewall setup reported an error"
msgstr "防火墙配置报告错误"

msgid "Last startup completed"
msgstr "最近一次启动已完成"

msgid "No completed startup record"
msgstr "暂无启动完成记录"

msgid "Global runtime"
msgstr "全局运行记录"

msgid "Firewall readiness recorded"
msgstr "已记录防火墙就绪"

msgid "No firewall readiness record"
msgstr "暂无防火墙就绪记录"

msgid "Runtime exit record"
msgstr "运行时出口记录"

msgid "Saved selection and runtime records can differ until changes are applied."
msgstr "保存的选择与运行记录可能不同，请应用配置后确认。"

msgid "Refresh"
msgstr "刷新"

msgid "Configure"
msgstr "配置"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "未知"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已停用"

msgid "Collecting data..."
msgstr "正在获取数据…"

msgid "Assign to a new device"
msgstr "分配给新设备"

msgid "One default exit. Device policies stay in control."
msgstr "统一默认出口，保留每台设备的选择。"

msgid "Choose the default proxy or OpenVPN exit here. Individual device rules take priority over the global policy."
msgstr "在这里选择默认代理或 OpenVPN 出口，单设备规则优先于全局策略。"

msgid "Switch protection preserves DHCP address assignment. While DNS is paused, open LuCI using the router LAN IP."
msgstr "切换保护保留 DHCP 地址分配。DNS 暂停期间，请使用路由器的 LAN IP 地址访问管理页面。"
